/**
 * Hand-written descriptions of the Kenney models for search and AI assistants (the import
 * architect matches objects on a drawing against them). Keyed by asset id. Each says what the
 * model is, how such an object looks on a plan drawing, where it is typically found, and
 * synonyms. Written from the preview images, not just the file names.
 *
 * Models in `KENNEY_AI_EXCLUDED` are kept out of AI catalogs: decor and tabletop items (markers
 * stand on the floor), wall- or ceiling-mounted items, construction pieces that duplicate the
 * plan's own walls, floors and doors, near-duplicate variants, and game pieces.
 *
 * Not generated: `scripts/import-kenney.mjs` regenerates only `catalog.ts` and warns about
 * models that have neither a description nor an exclusion here. Keep every id in exactly one of
 * the two (tests/kenney-descriptions.test.ts checks it).
 */

